                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-[2rem] p-6 border border-slate-100">
                                <h3 class="font-black text-feu-green mb-4 uppercase">
                                    Network Administration and Cybersecurity
                                </h3>

